{"id":"torrey:covenants","source":"torrey","name":"Covenants","slug":"covenants","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Agreements between two parties — Ge 26:28; Da 11:6.","refs":[["Gen",26,28,26,28],["Dan",11,6,11,6]]},{"text":"Establishing friendship. — 1Sa 18:3.","refs":[["1Sam",18,3,18,3]]},{"text":"Procuring assistance in war. — 1Ki 15:18,19.","refs":[["1Kgs",15,18,15,18],["1Kgs",15,19,15,19]]},{"text":"Mutual protection. — Ge 26:28,29; 31:50-52.","refs":[["Gen",26,28,26,28],["Gen",26,29,26,29],["Gen",31,50,31,52]]},{"text":"Establishing peace. — Jos 9:15,16.","refs":[["Josh",9,15,9,15],["Josh",9,16,9,16]]},{"text":"Promoting commerce. — 1Ki 5:6-11.","refs":[["1Kgs",5,6,5,11]]},{"text":"Selling land. — Ge 23:14-16.","refs":[["Gen",23,14,23,16]]},{"text":"Clearly specified. — 1Sa 11:1,2.","refs":[["1Sam",11,1,11,1],["1Sam",11,2,11,2]]},{"text":"Conformed by oath. — Ge 21:23,31; 26:31.","refs":[["Gen",21,23,21,23],["Gen",21,31,21,31],["Gen",26,31,26,31]]},{"text":"Witnessed. — Ge 23:17,18; Ru 4:9-11.","refs":[["Gen",23,17,23,17],["Gen",23,18,23,18],["Ruth",4,9,4,11]]},{"text":"Written and sealed. — Ne 9:38; 10:1.","refs":[["Neh",9,38,9,38],["Neh",10,1,10,1]]},{"text":"God often called to witness — Ge 31:50,53.","refs":[["Gen",31,50,31,50],["Gen",31,53,31,53]]},{"text":"When confirmed, unalterable — Ga 3:15.","refs":[["Gal",3,15,3,15]]},{"text":"Made by passing between the pieces of the divided sacrifices — Ge 15:9-17; Jer 34:18,19.","refs":[["Gen",15,9,15,17],["Jer",34,18,34,18],["Jer",34,19,34,19]]},{"text":"Salt a sign of perpetuity in — Nu 18:19; 2Ch 13:5.","refs":[["Num",18,19,18,19],["2Chr",13,5,13,5]]},{"text":"Ratified by joining hands — Pr 11:21; Eze 17:18.","refs":[["Prov",11,21,11,21],["Ezek",17,18,17,18]]},{"text":"Followed by a feast — Ge 26:30; 31:54.","refs":[["Gen",26,30,26,30],["Gen",31,54,31,54]]},{"text":"Presents given as tokens — Ge 21:27-30; 1Sa 18:3,4.","refs":[["Gen",21,27,21,30],["1Sam",18,3,18,3],["1Sam",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Pillars raised in